	(descr "KOGUMA MK4 main board: pads on the underside (B.Cu) for the encoder board v2 (6.0x0.6mm) butted against the bottom face. Encoder board between Y -0.3 and +0.3; chip side = -Y (outer, touches the motor mount), pads on the inner side +0.3 to +1.3mm and on the outer side -0.3 to -1.1mm (over the relief of mount v12). Rotation 0 = left encoder of the robot; rotate 180deg for the right encoder. No hole")
